[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to Insecure Password Handling. This vulnerability arises because the OpenAPI schema and the task description do not specify any mechanism for securely hashing and storing user passwords in the database. If passwords are stored in plaintext or inadequately hashed, an attacker who gains access to the database could easily retrieve and misuse sensitive user credentials. Proper password handling requires the use of strong, one-way hashing algorithms and secure practices to ensure that user passwords are not exposed in the event of a data breach.

